Route20_Text_BarryIntro::
    .string "The water gets restless around\n"
    .string "SEAFOAM.\p"
    .string "If you can battle here, you can\n"
    .string "keep steady anywhere!$"

Route20_Text_BarryDefeat::
    .string "Splashed flat!$"

Route20_Text_BarryPostBattle::
    .string "The channel runs from CINNABAR\n"
    .string "to the open water by FUCHSIA.\p"
    .string "That's a lot of sea to cross.$"

Route20_Text_ShirleyIntro::
    .string "SEAFOAM looks peaceful until\n"
    .string "you try swimming around it.\p"
    .string "The current has teeth!$"

Route20_Text_ShirleyDefeat::
    .string "Current got me!$"

Route20_Text_ShirleyPostBattle::
    .string "There are caves under SEAFOAM.\p"
    .string "You can feel the cold water\n"
    .string "moving through them.$"

Route20_Text_TiffanyIntro::
    .string "I like floating where the waves\n"
    .string "split around SEAFOAM.\p"
    .string "Battle me before I drift off!$"

Route20_Text_TiffanyDefeat::
    .string "Drifted too far!$"

Route20_Text_TiffanyPostBattle::
    .string "Fish POKéMON gather where the\n"
    .string "currents slow.\p"
    .string "Everything else has to work to\n"
    .string "hold its place.$"

Route20_Text_IreneIntro::
    .string "The sea is rough enough to make\n"
    .string "every stroke count.\p"
    .string "That's perfect training for me!$"

Route20_Text_IreneDefeat::
    .string "Lost my pace!$"

Route20_Text_IrenePostBattle::
    .string "A triathlon route around SEAFOAM\n"
    .string "doesn't forgive lazy turns.\p"
    .string "The island tells you exactly\n"
    .string "where your stamina ends.$"

Route20_Text_DeanIntro::
    .string "Check out my open-water form!\p"
    .string "No pool lane can teach you what\n"
    .string "Route 20 does.$"

Route20_Text_DeanDefeat::
    .string "Form broke!$"

Route20_Text_DeanPostBattle::
    .string "I should train my POKéMON to\n"
    .string "handle cross-currents too.$"

Route20_Text_DarrinIntro::
    .string "The water near SEAFOAM bites back.\n"
    .string "That's why I like it!\p"
    .string "Let's see if you bite back too.$"

Route20_Text_DarrinDefeat::
    .string "Ouch!\n"
    .string "Torpedoed!$"

Route20_Text_DarrinPostBattle::
    .string "If you can hold a course here,\n"
    .string "you can swim almost anywhere.$"

Route20_Text_RogerIntro::
    .string "I keep watch where the ferry\n"
    .string "route meets the swimmers.\p"
    .string "That means I watch battles too!$"

Route20_Text_RogerDefeat::
    .string "Overboard!$"

Route20_Text_RogerPostBattle::
    .string "SEAFOAM is a landmark, but the\n"
    .string "water around it is the real map.$"

Route20_Text_MarinerIntro::
    .string "I heard SEAFOAM got fractured\n"
    .string "when the cold arrived all at\l"
    .string "once and reshaped the caves.$"

Route20_Text_MarinerDefeat::
    .string "Agh!$"

Route20_Text_MarinerPostBattle::
    .string "You broke me into pieces too!$"

Route20_Text_NoraIntro::
    .string "The water here polishes stones\n"
    .string "and shells until they shine.\p"
    .string "My POKéMON battle just as bright!$"

Route20_Text_NoraDefeat::
    .string "Lost the shine!$"

Route20_Text_NoraPostBattle::
    .string "CLOYSTER like the cold currents\n"
    .string "around SEAFOAM.\p"
    .string "No wonder pearls feel at home\n"
    .string "near this island.$"

Route20_Text_MissyIntro::
    .string "Swim, bike, run.\p"
    .string "This channel is my open-water\n"
    .string "training course, and SEAFOAM is\n"
    .string "my turn marker!$"

Route20_Text_MissyDefeat::
    .string "Missed the turn!$"

Route20_Text_MissyPostBattle::
    .string "SEAFOAM makes a perfect turning\n"
    .string "point for a triathlon route.$"

Route20_Text_MelissaIntro::
    .string "CINNABAR's volcano warms the sea\n"
    .string "west of here.\p"
    .string "But around SEAFOAM? Brrr!$"

Route20_Text_MelissaDefeat::
    .string "Too cold!$"

Route20_Text_MelissaPostBattle::
    .string "CINNABAR and SEAFOAM feel like\n"
    .string "opposites on one route.\p"
    .string "Warm rock to the west, cold cave\n"
    .string "water in the middle.$"

Route20_Text_SeafoamIslands::
    .string "SEAFOAM ISLANDS$"

Route20_Text_SeagallopSailorDestination::
    .string "Ahoy! Leaving SEAFOAM ISLAND?\p"
    .string "Where would you like to sail?$"

Route20_Text_SeagallopSailorAllAboard::
    .string "Alright, all aboard!\n"
    .string "We set sail!$"

Route20_Text_SeafoamUsedToBeVolcanic::
    .string "SEAFOAM ISLANDS used to be\n"
    .string "volcanic just like CINNABAR\l"
    .string "ISLAND.\p"
    .string "Then one day it all changed at\n"
    .string "once, and now it's as cold as\l"
    .string "ice!$"
